<title>PHILIPPINES: Ever says 9-mth net at 92.762 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>Ever says 9-mth net at 92.762 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Retailing firm Ever-Gotesco Resources and Holdings Inc said on Tuesday it posted net income of 92.762 million pesos in the first nine months of the year.</p>
<p>Operating revenue reached 264.294 million pesos, while cost and operating expenses totalled 155.335 million pesos.</p>
<p>No further details were available.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
</text>
